"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span></span></span></span>，双原子为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac52 nR\\Delta T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.00773em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span></span></span></span>；本题只需要&quot;温度变才变&quot;这一层），温度不变 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta U=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步（做功）</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_2&gt;V_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（体积增大）⇒ 气体对外界做功，外界对气体做功为负（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步（热一律）</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q+W=\\Delta U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">U</span></span></span></span> ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=-W&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span> ⇒ 气体从外界<strong>吸热</strong>，且吸收的热量与对外做功的数值相等。</p>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>一句话判三样</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;看 pV，扩热缩小&quot;</strong>：体积变大→对外做功；温度不变（等温线/等温说）→内能不变；又做功又不减内能→必吸热。\n<strong>口诀</strong>：<strong>&quot;做正功（对外）必吸热，做负功（外界做入）必放热；想变内能看温度，温度不变能不通&quot;</strong>——（等温 ΔU=0）\n<strong>图三看</strong>：看曲线走向（等温=双曲线、等压=水平线、等容=竖直线）；看图下面积（=做功大小，带符号）；看曲线离原点远近（等温线更远温度更高）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：内能只看温度、功只看体积变化方向—这两件事不用算气体内能积分；再找个&quot;能量账本&quot;（热一律）平衡，吸放热自然就出来了。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"一定质量的理想气体由状态 A A A （ p 1 = 2 × 1 0 5 P a p_1=2\\times10^5\\,\\mathrm{Pa} p 1 ​ = 2 × 1 0 5 Pa ， V 1 = 1 L V_1=1\\,\\mathrm{L}","source":"自编（经典考法：气体状态变化+热一律为新课标高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"等温过程=双曲线（pV 定值），温度不变⇒内能不变（理想气体）；体积增大⇒气体对外做功（图中曲线下方面积为做功大小）；热一律 Q+W=ΔU 用\"Q 吸热为正、W 外界对气体做功为正\"，符号别混。","fit":["p-V 图某两状态间的吸放热/做功/内能判断","等温/等压/等容过程的区别","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Mar 04 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"thermodynamics","title":"热学"},{"slug":"thermo","title":"热学"},{"slug":"gas-process-analysis","title":"p-V 图过程分析（热力学第一定律）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"gas-state","title":"理想气体状态变化（比例法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"isotherm-image","title":"等温线图像（离原点越远温度越高）","type":"example"},{"slug":"thermo","title":"热学","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"variable-mass-gas","title":"变质量气体（充气/抽气/漏气）","type":"example"},{"slug":"water-molecules","title":"水分子数估算（ρ/M × N_A）","type":"example"}]}